    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Super Micro Computer, Inc. is a public company headquartered in San Jose, California, trading under the ticker SMCI. Its website describes the company as \"The premier provider of advanced Server Building Block Solutions\" for 5G/Edge, Data Center, Cloud, Enterprise, Big Data, HPC and Embedded markets worldwide. The site lists data center servers, blades, data storage, and AI systems among its offerings.\n\nThe company's site emphasizes GPU servers for modern data centers and describes its AI systems as featuring the latest multi-GPU and interconnect technologies. It also highlights short-depth and small form factor systems designed to deliver compute, AI, and connectivity performance to the edge of the network.\n\nAdditional records show the company has SEC CIK number 0001375365 and is listed as a for-profit public company. California legal exposure records list 281 entries for the company. No product or litigation case details beyond these are present in the provided data.",
